          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p><b>2. (0.25 mark)</b> Modify/replace the data for the resource. Copy the content of the <b>courses.json</b> file (given as database.json: 10 courses, ids 1–10; completed: 1, 3, 6, 8, 10; in progress: 2, 4, 5, 7, 9).</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p><b>2. (0,25 điểm)</b> Sửa/thay dữ liệu của resource bằng nội dung file <b>courses.json</b> (phát dưới tên database.json: 10 khoá id 1–10; đã xong: 1, 3, 6, 8, 10; đang học: 2, 4, 5, 7, 9).</p></div>",
          "sampleSolution": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><pre><code>// database.json (= courses.json)\n{\n  \"courses\": [\n    { \"id\": 1, \"courseName\": \"REACT NATIVE\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/0/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 100, \"isCompleted\": true, \"courseType\": \"Web/Design\" },\n    { \"id\": 2, \"courseName\": \"DATA SCIENCE\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/2/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 40, \"isCompleted\": false, \"courseType\": \"Data Science\" },\n    { \"id\": 3, \"courseName\": \"WEB SECURITY\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/3/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 100, \"isCompleted\": true, \"courseType\": \"Security\" },\n    { \"id\": 4, \"courseName\": \"NODE JS\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/4/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 75, \"isCompleted\": false, \"courseType\": \"Web/Design\" },\n    { \"id\": 5, \"courseName\": \"MACHINE LEARNING\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/5/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 15, \"isCompleted\": false, \"courseType\": \"Data Science\" },\n    { \"id\": 6, \"courseName\": \"ETHICAL HACKING\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/6/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 100, \"isCompleted\": true, \"courseType\": \"Security\" },\n    { \"id\": 7, \"courseName\": \"UI DESIGN\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/7/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 60, \"isCompleted\": false, \"courseType\": \"Web/Design\" },\n    { \"id\": 8, \"courseName\": \"BIG DATA\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/8/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 100, \"isCompleted\": true, \"courseType\": \"Data Science\" },\n    { \"id\": 9, \"courseName\": \"NETWORK SECURITY\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/9/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 85, \"isCompleted\": false, \"courseType\": \"Security\" },\n    { \"id\": 10, \"courseName\": \"REACT JS\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/10/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 100, \"isCompleted\": true, \"courseType\": \"Web/Design\" }\n  ]\n}</code></pre><p>The 10 courses mix completed (1, 3, 6, 8, 10) and in-progress (2, 4, 5, 7, 9) items so Home, Completed Courses and the id-desc sort (10 must come before 9) are all visible. Field names match the schema exactly.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><pre><code>// database.json (= courses.json)\n{\n  \"courses\": [\n    { \"id\": 1, \"courseName\": \"REACT NATIVE\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/0/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 100, \"isCompleted\": true, \"courseType\": \"Web/Design\" },\n    { \"id\": 2, \"courseName\": \"DATA SCIENCE\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/2/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 40, \"isCompleted\": false, \"courseType\": \"Data Science\" },\n    { \"id\": 3, \"courseName\": \"WEB SECURITY\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/3/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 100, \"isCompleted\": true, \"courseType\": \"Security\" },\n    { \"id\": 4, \"courseName\": \"NODE JS\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/4/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 75, \"isCompleted\": false, \"courseType\": \"Web/Design\" },\n    { \"id\": 5, \"courseName\": \"MACHINE LEARNING\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/5/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 15, \"isCompleted\": false, \"courseType\": \"Data Science\" },\n    { \"id\": 6, \"courseName\": \"ETHICAL HACKING\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/6/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 100, \"isCompleted\": true, \"courseType\": \"Security\" },\n    { \"id\": 7, \"courseName\": \"UI DESIGN\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/7/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 60, \"isCompleted\": false, \"courseType\": \"Web/Design\" },\n    { \"id\": 8, \"courseName\": \"BIG DATA\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/8/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 100, \"isCompleted\": true, \"courseType\": \"Data Science\" },\n    { \"id\": 9, \"courseName\": \"NETWORK SECURITY\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/9/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 85, \"isCompleted\": false, \"courseType\": \"Security\" },\n    { \"id\": 10, \"courseName\": \"REACT JS\", \"courseImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/10/300/200\", \"percentLearning\": 100, \"isCompleted\": true, \"courseType\": \"Web/Design\" }\n  ]\n}</code></pre><p>10 khoá trộn đã xong (1, 3, 6, 8, 10) và đang học (2, 4, 5, 7, 9) để Home, Completed Courses và sắp giảm theo id (10 phải đứng trước 9) đều thấy được. Tên trường khớp schema.</p></div>",
