          "kind": "WRITE",
          "points": 2,
          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p><b>4. (2 marks)</b> At the <b>Home</b> route, show all the courses which are not completed (<b>percentLearning &lt; 100 or isCompleted = false</b>). Display all courses by <b>grid</b>. Each course should contain the information: <b>courseName</b>, <b>courseImage</b>, <b>courseType</b>, and <b>percentLearning</b>. When you click the image of a course, the view switches to the <b>Course Detail</b> page.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p><b>4. (2 điểm)</b> Ở route <b>Home</b>, hiện mọi khoá CHƯA hoàn thành (<b>percentLearning &lt; 100 hoặc isCompleted = false</b>) dạng <b>lưới (grid)</b>. Mỗi khoá có: <b>courseName</b>, <b>courseImage</b>, <b>courseType</b>, <b>percentLearning</b>. Bấm vào ảnh khoá học thì chuyển sang trang <b>Course Detail</b>.</p></div>",
          "sampleSolution": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><pre><code>// src/components/Home.js\nimport { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport { Row, Col, Card, ProgressBar } from \"react-bootstrap\";\nimport { getCourses, isNotCompleted } from \"../api\";\n\n// Item 4: Home = not completed courses, displayed as a grid\nexport default function Home() {\n  const [courses, setCourses] = useState([]);\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n\n  useEffect(() =&gt; { getCourses().then(setCourses); }, []);\n\n  return (\n    &lt;&gt;\n      &lt;h3 className=\"mb-3\"&gt;Home — Courses in progress&lt;/h3&gt;\n      &lt;Row xs={1} sm={2} md={3} lg={4} className=\"g-3\"&gt;\n        {courses.filter(isNotCompleted).map((c) =&gt; (\n          &lt;Col key={c.id}&gt;\n            &lt;Card className=\"h-100 course-card\"&gt;\n              &lt;Card.Img variant=\"top\" src={c.courseImage} alt={c.courseName}\n                style={{ cursor: \"pointer\", height: 150, objectFit: \"cover\" }}\n                onClick={() =&gt; navigate(`/detail/${c.id}`)} /&gt;\n              &lt;Card.Body&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Title&gt;{c.courseName}&lt;/Card.Title&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Text className=\"mb-1\"&gt;Type: {c.courseType}&lt;/Card.Text&gt;\n                &lt;ProgressBar now={c.percentLearning} label={`${c.percentLearning}%`} /&gt;\n              &lt;/Card.Body&gt;\n            &lt;/Card&gt;\n          &lt;/Col&gt;\n        ))}\n      &lt;/Row&gt;\n    &lt;/&gt;\n  );\n}</code></pre><p>Fetch once in <code>useEffect</code>, filter with <code>percentLearning &lt; 100 || isCompleted === false</code> (5 courses), render a Bootstrap grid of cards; the image navigates to <code>/detail/:id</code>.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><pre><code>// src/components/Home.js\nimport { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport { Row, Col, Card, ProgressBar } from \"react-bootstrap\";\nimport { getCourses, isNotCompleted } from \"../api\";\n\n// Item 4: Home = not completed courses, displayed as a grid\nexport default function Home() {\n  const [courses, setCourses] = useState([]);\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n\n  useEffect(() =&gt; { getCourses().then(setCourses); }, []);\n\n  return (\n    &lt;&gt;\n      &lt;h3 className=\"mb-3\"&gt;Home — Courses in progress&lt;/h3&gt;\n      &lt;Row xs={1} sm={2} md={3} lg={4} className=\"g-3\"&gt;\n        {courses.filter(isNotCompleted).map((c) =&gt; (\n          &lt;Col key={c.id}&gt;\n            &lt;Card className=\"h-100 course-card\"&gt;\n              &lt;Card.Img variant=\"top\" src={c.courseImage} alt={c.courseName}\n                style={{ cursor: \"pointer\", height: 150, objectFit: \"cover\" }}\n                onClick={() =&gt; navigate(`/detail/${c.id}`)} /&gt;\n              &lt;Card.Body&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Title&gt;{c.courseName}&lt;/Card.Title&gt;\n                &lt;Card.Text className=\"mb-1\"&gt;Type: {c.courseType}&lt;/Card.Text&gt;\n                &lt;ProgressBar now={c.percentLearning} label={`${c.percentLearning}%`} /&gt;\n              &lt;/Card.Body&gt;\n            &lt;/Card&gt;\n          &lt;/Col&gt;\n        ))}\n      &lt;/Row&gt;\n    &lt;/&gt;\n  );\n}</code></pre><p>Lấy dữ liệu một lần trong <code>useEffect</code>, lọc <code>percentLearning &lt; 100 || isCompleted === false</code> (5 khoá), hiện lưới Card; bấm ảnh sang <code>/detail/:id</code>.</p></div>",
